title: Rinthel Runtime Architecture
direction: right

Browser client [icon: browser]
External LLM [icon: cloud, type: external, label: "External LLM (OpenRouter/Anthropic)", row: 9, col: 2]

Host Machine {
  Rinthel TUI [icon: python, label: "Rinthel TUI (orchestrator)"]
  llama-server [icon: server, label: "llama-server (CUDA) 127.0.0.1:8080", row: 2, col: 1]
  net-fix [icon: firewall, type: security, label: "understory-net-fix.service (systemd, NAT/iptables)"]

  Docker Engine {
    Understory stack {
      Understory [icon: docker, label: "Understory ghcr.io/thecodacus/understory, :3800"]
    }

    Pithagoras stack {
      Pithagoras [icon: server, label: "Pithagoras portal (network_mode: host, :4100)"]
      portal-db [icon: sqlite, label: "portal.db (SQLite)"]
      Tailscale [icon: vpn, type: security, label: "Tailscale sidecar (optional)"]
      Discord [icon: discord]
      Slack [icon: slack, type: external]
      Telegram [icon: telegram]

      Voice add-on {
        whisper.cpp [icon: server, label: "whisper.cpp :8178"]
        audio.cpp [icon: server, label: "breeze / audio.cpp :7861 / :7860"]
      }
    }
  }
}

Rinthel TUI > llama-server: spawns (LocalProcessService)
Rinthel TUI > Understory: docker compose up/down {labelDy: 49}
Rinthel TUI > Pithagoras: docker compose up/down
Browser client > Pithagoras: HTTPS/SSE :4100
Pithagoras > llama-server: HTTP :8080, OpenAI-compatible {fromSide: bottom, toSide: top}
Pithagoras > Understory: MCP :3800, bearer token
Understory > llama-server: host.docker.internal -> NAT -> 127.0.0.1:8080
net-fix > Understory: enables {style: dotted}
Pithagoras > External LLM: fallback (PI_PROVIDER/PI_MODEL) {style: dashed}
Pithagoras > portal-db
Pithagoras > Tailscale {style: dashed}
Pithagoras > Discord: optional channel {style: dashed}
Pithagoras > Slack: optional channel {style: dashed}
Pithagoras > Telegram: optional channel {style: dashed}
Pithagoras > whisper.cpp: /inference
Pithagoras > audio.cpp: /v1/audio/speech
